      "description": {
        "zh": "实例的状态，取值说明：\n- **CREATING**：创建中。\n\n- **ACTIVATION**：运行中。\n\n- **RESOURCE_CHANGING**：变配中。\n\n- **ORDER_PREPARING**：订单确认中。\n\n- **READONLY_RESOURCE_CHANGING**：资源变配中（实例写入锁定）。\n\n- **DELETING**：删除中。",
        "en": "The state of the instance. Valid values:\n\n- **CREATING**: The instance is being created.\n\n- **ACTIVATION**: The instance is running.\n\n- **RESOURCE\\_CHANGING**: The instance is being upgraded or downgraded.\n\n- **ORDER\\_PREPARING**: The order is being confirmed.\n\n- **READONLY\\_RESOURCE\\_CHANGING**: The instance configuration is being changed, and the instance is write-locked.\n\n- **DELETING**: The instance is being deleted."
      }
